WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.953
You are burning through your window right
now.

00:00:02.953 --> 00:00:08.218
Window glass blocks the burning rays but
it lets the ageing ones straight through.

00:00:08.218 --> 00:00:11.492
I know, wearing sunscreen indoors feels
ridiculous.

00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:16.692
I thought so too until I saw a photo of a
truck driver's face after thirty years.

00:00:16.692 --> 00:00:21.250
One pump in the morning. That is the whole
ask. It takes eight seconds.
